#: ExportsPlugin.php:80
msgid "Exports"
msgstr "Eksportimised"

#: controllers/IndexController.php:31
msgid "Configure your export below."
msgstr "Seadista oma eksportimist allpool."

#: controllers/IndexController.php:88
#, php-format
msgid "Exporting \"%s\"."
msgstr "\"%s\" eksportimine."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:11
msgid "Records"
msgstr "Sissekanded"

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:16
msgid "Export a file containing data about selected records."
msgstr "Ekspordi fail andmetega valitud sissekannete kohta."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:37
msgid "Select the type of record to export."
msgstr "Vali, mis liiki sissekannet eksportida."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:42
msgid "Search Query"
msgstr "Otsingupäring"

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:43
msgid ""
"Enter the query used to filter the records to be exported. If no query is "
"entered, all available records will be exported. For many records, the "
"search query is the URL query string of a record browse page."
msgstr ""
"Sisesta päring, mida kasutatakse eksporditavate sissekannete eksportimiseks."
" Kui päringut pole sisestatud, siis eksporditakse kõik saadaolevad "
"sissekanded. Paljude sissekannete jaoks on otsingupäring sissekannete "
"sirvimise lehe URL."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:47
msgid "Select the format of the export file."
msgstr "Vali eksporditava faili vorming."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:56
msgid "Multivalue Separator"
msgstr "Mitme väärtuse eraldaja"

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Records.php:57
msgid ""
"Enter the character to separate multiple values in a cell. This only applies"
" to the CSV format."
msgstr ""
"Sisesta märk, mis eraldab mitu ühes lahtris olevat väärtust. Seda "
"rakendatakse ainult CSV-vormingule."

#: libraries/Exports/Exporter/Unknown.php:18
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown [%s]"
msgstr "Tundmatu [%s]"

#: libraries/Exports/Form/Export.php:15 views/admin/index/browse.php:8
#: views/admin/index/show.php:13
msgid "Exporter"
msgstr "Eksportija"

#: views/admin/exports-config-form.php:4
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Invalid storage directory. This is the directory where exports will be "
"stored and available for download. You will not be able to create exports "
"until the \"%s\" directory exists and is writable by the web server."
msgstr ""
"Vigane kaust. See on kaust, kuhu eksportimised salvestatakse ja kust need "
"alla laaditakse. Sa ei saa midagi eksportida enne, kui kaust \"%s\" on "
"olemas ja serveris kirjutatav."

#: views/admin/exports-config-form.php:10
msgid "Working directory"
msgstr "Töökaust"

#: views/admin/exports-config-form.php:13
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the directory where your exports will be built. The "
"directory must exist and be writable by the web server."
msgstr ""
"Sisesta kaust, kuhu eksportimised pannakse. See kaust peab olemas olema ja "
"ei tohi olla kirjutuskaitstud."

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:3 views/admin/index/show.php:12
msgid "Browse Exports"
msgstr "Sirvi eksportimisi"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:9 views/admin/index/show.php:15
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Staatus"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:10
msgid "Owner"
msgstr "Omanik"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:11
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Loodud"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:15
msgid "Top pagination"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:18
msgid "Create an Export"
msgstr "Loo eksport"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:39 views/admin/index/show.php:16
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tundmatu"

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:50
msgid "No exports found."
msgstr "Ühtegi eksportimist ei leitud."

#: views/admin/index/browse.php:54
msgid "Bottom pagination"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/index/export.php:3 views/admin/index/set-exporter.php:2
msgid "Create Export"
msgstr "Loo eksport"

#: views/admin/index/export.php:18
msgid "Begin Export"
msgstr "Alusta eksportimist"

#: views/admin/index/set-exporter.php:7
msgid "What would you like to export?"
msgstr "Mida sa sooviksid eksportida?"

#: views/admin/index/set-exporter.php:22
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Järgmine"

#: views/admin/index/show.php:5
#, php-format
